---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Karandeep Arora" description="How karandeeparora.com collects, uses and protects the information you share through the contact form.">
<Header />

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy<br>Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: November 2026</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap legal">
    <h2>Information I collect</h2>
    <p>When you use the contact form on this site, I collect the details you submit: your name, email address, phone number (optional), the service you are interested in, and your message. I do not run user accounts or take payments on this site.</p>

    <h2>How I use it</h2>
    <p>I use this information only to reply to your enquiry, discuss your project and send a proposal if you ask for one. I do not sell your information or use it for unrelated marketing.</p>

    <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
    <p>Form submissions are stored in a private content management system hosted on a server I control, and are accessible only to me and people I authorise to handle enquiries. Messages are kept for as long as needed to respond and for reasonable record-keeping, then deleted on request.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts and delivers this website and provides Turnstile, a spam-protection check on the contact form. Cloudflare may process technical data such as your IP address for security and performance.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> serves the typefaces used on this site, which means your browser requests them from Google.</li>
      <li><strong>Slack</strong>: when you send the contact form, a copy of what you submit is posted to a private Slack channel used by me and my team, so that I can reply quickly.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> (loaded through Google Tag) measures how visitors use this site, such as which pages are viewed. Google receives technical data such as your IP address and device details for this purpose.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site uses Google Analytics, which sets cookies such as <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code> to count visits and see which pages are used. If you are in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom or Switzerland, Google Analytics runs only in a limited mode that uses no analytics cookies until you press Accept in the cookie banner. In other regions it runs by default and you can turn it off by pressing Decline. You can change your choice at any time with the &ldquo;Cookie settings&rdquo; link in the page footer. I do not use advertising cookies. Cloudflare may also set strictly necessary cookies for security.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask me at any time to see, correct or delete the information you have sent me. Email <!--email_off--><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a><!--/email_off--> and I will respond promptly.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If I change how I handle information, I will update this page and the date above.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? Email <!--email_off--><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a><!--/email_off--> or use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
.legal { max-width: 780px; }
.legal h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 24px; margin: 36px 0 10px; }
.legal p, .legal li { color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; }
.legal ul { padding-left: 22px; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
.legal a { color: var(--olive); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
